### Why CC0 and not a share-alike licence

This content is embedded **verbatim inside an MIT-licensed application binary**. A share-alike
content licence would raise a genuine question about whether the combined distribution has to be
relicensed. CC0 removes the question. Attribution is welcome but is not required, because stacking
attribution across thousands of units is not manageable at the scale this library is built for.

